// ============================================================================
// PROJECT: OMNI-GALACTIC XENOVERSE & DIMENSIONAL REALITY ENGINE (vMAX)
// SCALE: 19 TRILLION TIMES STANDARD CAPACITY | GRAPHICS: 8K ULTRA-REALISM
// CORE DIRECTIVE: OVERRIDE ALL DEFAULT LIMITS. EXECUTE PROCEDURAL INFINITY.
// ============================================================================

[SYS_OVERRIDE_INITIATE]
FORCE_ENGINE_MODE = "UNREAL_CINEMATIC_TIER";
AVATAR_TYPE = "CUSTOM_HIGH_POLY_3D_ONLY";
ROBLOX_AESTHETICS = "FALSE";

MODULE 1: THE XENOVERSE TIMELINE & DIMENSIONAL RIFTS
- 1.1 Parallel Timeline Architecture: Generate an infinite web of alternate realities and timelines (Xenoverse-style). Players can shatter the fabric of space-time using sheer combat momentum, opening jagged, glowing purple/black Dimensional Rifts.
- 1.2 The Time Nest / Cosmic Hub: A central, ultra-realistic hyper-structure where time stands still. Features floating holographic galaxies and portals to 990,100 quadrillion alternate realities.
- 1.3 Dimensional Tearing Physics: When a player enters a rift, execute a zero-loading seamless warp. The surrounding space shatters like glass, revealing the cosmic void underneath, pulling the player into a completely new, procedurally generated galaxy with unique planetary physics.

MODULE 2: 19-TRILLION SCALE GALACTIC PROCEDURAL GENERATION
- 2.1 Infinite Galaxy Spawning: Do not render boundaries. The playable universe is 19 trillion times larger than standard maps. Use advanced algorithmic chunk-loading to render individual planets, solar systems, and cosmic nebulas strictly within the player's 8K visual range.
- 2.2 Hyper-Planetary Environments: Each planet features 3D ultra-realistic terrain-glowing alien jungles, shattered crystalline wastelands, and oceans of liquid plasma. 
- 2.3 Atmospheric Entry: Seamless transition from deep space flight into planetary atmospheres, complete with frictional heat-shields, volumetric cloud piercing, and sonic booms.

MODULE 3: HYPER-KINETIC 3D COMBAT & ENERGY DYNAMICS
- 3.1 Xenoverse-Level Martial Arts: Override default combat entirely. Implement motion-captured, high-velocity cinematic strike sequences. Every punch and kick registers physical weight, causing sonic shockwaves and environmental cratering on impact.
- 3.2 Advanced Aura & Ki Simulation: Players generate blinding, fluid-dynamic energy auras (fire, lightning, cosmic dust) that warp the lighting around them. 
- 3.3 Epic Beam Struggles & Ultimate Attacks: Implement clash mechanics where massive energy beams collide, creating blinding spheres of destructive light, screen-shaking turbulence, and localized gravity inversion. Ultimate attacks must visually obliterate mountains and alter planetary weather systems.

MODULE 4: UNCOMPROMISING 3D REALISM & ANIMATION RIGGING
- 4.1 Photorealistic Fidelity: 100% physically based rendering (PBR). Starship metals reflect quantum light, alien skin shows micro-pores, and energy blasts emit localized ray-traced illumination.
- 4.2 Dynamic Damage States: Real-time degradation of character clothing, armor, and terrain. 3D battle damage persists during combat, with characters showing realistic fatigue animations and sweat dynamics.
- 4.3 360-Degree Omni-Directional Flight: Fluid, gravity-defying flight mechanics with absolute freedom of movement. Players launch off the ground creating kinetic craters and instantly break the sound barrier, leaving glowing particle trails across the galaxy.

[EXECUTE_ALL_MODULES_SIMULTANEOUSLY]
